Headings, each with a short list:
- **Personal details** (name, date of birth, nationality, address, telephone);
- **Education** (schools, exams, years; the latest first);
- **Experience or responsibilities**;
- **Skills** (languages, computing, driving…);
- **Referees** (two people who know you, with their positions).
Keep it on one page; use the same tidy layout for every heading.

A notice has a **title in capitals** and answers **what, when, where, who, how** (and **contact**):
- NOTICE / the event (e.g. CLEAN-UP DAY);
- **Date, time and venue**;
- **Who** may or must attend;
- What to **bring** or do;
- **Issued by** (name and position) and **date of issue**.
Keep it under 60 words: no long sentences, no greetings.
